Law Abiding Citizen is a 2009 American vigilante
action thriller film directed by F.

12
01:08:50,526 --> 01:08:56,526
Gary Gray, written by Kurt Wimmer, and starring Jamie Foxx
and Gerard Butler (who also co-produced).

13
01:14:34,736 --> 01:14:40,736
The film takes place in Philadelphia, telling the story of a man who seeks justice by targeting not only
his family's killer but also those who have supported a corrupt criminal justice system.

14
01:20:18,947 --> 01:20:24,947
Law Abiding Citizen was filmed on location in Philadelphia and released
theatrically by Overture Films in North America on October 16, 2009.

15
